  "key": "pr-724",
  "fields": {
    "summary": "fix(release): direct-push version ledger to main (fa-style), no more chore PRs",
    "description": "Companion to the ruleset change (bypass actor Integration 5153011 added to main-protection). The pack release now pushes the bumped versions.json straight to main — same as fa's release commits — instead of opening a chore PR that burns conveyor gates. Guards preserved: no-op guard when main already carries the versions; rebase onto fresh main before push; rejected push warns and the next release recomputes."
  }
}

